<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>ANTIGRAVITY // Stream-Safe Mission Control</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        color-scheme: dark;
        --bg: #05070d;
        --panel: #0d1320;
        --panel2: #121a2a;
        --line: #263248;
        --ink: #eef4ff;
        --muted: #8fa1bd;
        --green: #2bd576;
        --yellow: #f1b83b;
        --red: #ff5d6c;
        --blue: #58a6ff;
      }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, #12213d 0, var(--bg) 45%);
        color: var(--ink);
        font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, sans-serif;
      }
      header, footer {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 16px 22px;
        background: rgba(5, 7, 13, 0.88);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      }
      footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 0; color: var(--muted); }
      h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
      .tag { color: var(--muted); font: 700 11px/1.3 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; text-transform: uppercase; }
      main { padding: 22px; display: grid; gap: 18px; }
      .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 14px; }
      .card { background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--panel), var(--panel2)); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; padding: 16px; box-shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.22); }
      .card h2 { margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }
      .state { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font: 800 24px/1 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; }
      .dot { width: 13px; height: 13px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--yellow); box-shadow: 0 0 18px currentColor; }
      .green { color: var(--green); } .green .dot { background: var(--green); }
      .yellow { color: var(--yellow); } .yellow .dot { background: var(--yellow); }
      .red { color: var(--red); } .red .dot { background: var(--red); }
      .blue { color: var(--blue); } .blue .dot { background: var(--blue); }
      .small { margin-top: 10px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.45; }
      .lane { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 180px 130px 1fr 170px; gap: 12px; padding: 11px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); align-items: center; }
      .lane:first-child { border-top: 0; }
      .mono { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; }
      .safe { border-color: rgba(43,213,118,.45); }
      @media (max-width: 1100px) { .grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } .lane { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <div>
        <h1>ANTIGRAVITY Mission Control</h1>
        <div class="tag">stream-safe public operations view · no secrets · no customer data</div>
      </div>
      <div class="tag" id="clock">loading…</div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="grid">
        <div class="card safe"><h2>Public stream</h2><div class="state blue"><span class="dot"></span>READY</div><div class="small">OBS/YouTube-safe surface. Private Hermes Desktop panes stay off-stream.</div></div>
        <div class="card"><h2>Sabretooth</h2><div class="state yellow"><span class="dot"></span>CONTROL</div><div class="small">Hermes + Paperweight/Paperclip CEO board. Health must come from validated local API shape.</div></div>
        <div class="card"><h2>T5500 date app</h2><div class="state yellow"><span class="dot"></span>VERIFYING</div><div class="small">Port 3200 returned HTML from Sabretooth. Payment path still needs redacted non-destructive probe.</div></div>
        <div class="card"><h2>9020 business</h2><div class="state yellow"><span class="dot"></span>AUTH GATE</div><div class="small">Port 3050 reachable and redirects to login. Needs health endpoint/body-shape proof for green.</div></div>
      </section>

      <section class="card">
        <h2>CEO lanes controlled by Hermes</h2>
        <div class="lane"><strong>YouAndINotAI</strong><span class="mono yellow">yellow</span><span>Date app + support + payment health on T5500.</span><span class="mono">youandinotai</span></div>
        <div class="lane"><strong>AI-Solutions</strong><span class="mono yellow">yellow</span><span>AI product/store lane; payment health redacted.</span><span class="mono">ai-solutions</span></div>
        <div class="lane"><strong>Business Exchange</strong><span class="mono yellow">yellow</span><span>9020 marketplace/operator workflow.</span><span class="mono">business-exchange</span></div>
        <div class="lane"><strong>Hermes Sideworld</strong><span class="mono blue">control</span><span>One-root orchestration, public dashboard safety, node health.</span><span class="mono">hermes-sideworld</span></div>
        <div class="lane"><strong>Marketing</strong><span class="mono yellow">queued</span><span>Markets the three public platforms via specialist lanes.</span><span class="mono">marketing</span></div>
        <div class="lane"><strong>YouTube</strong><span class="mono yellow">queued</span><span>24/7 stream content engine and public mission programming.</span><span class="mono">youtube</span></div>
      </section>

      <section class="card safe">
        <h2>What is intentionally not shown</h2>
        <div class="small">No credentials, tokens, RDP passwords, raw env values, auth files, customer PII, private doctrine, raw payment-provider responses, or terminal panes that can leak secrets. Green status requires real checks; empty or malformed 200 responses are not green.</div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <span>Public-safe workstream view for streamed building sessions.</span>
      <span class="mono">Source: C:\antigravity · Branch: main</span>
    </footer>
    <script>
      const tick = () => { document.getElementById('clock').textContent = new Date().toLocaleString(); };
      tick(); setInterval(tick, 1000);
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
